  "notes": [
   "The catalog prints no units beside individual courses, so all course units are null.",
   "No overall total is printed for the certificate; area totals are 9 (Area 1), 3 (Area 2), 6 (Area 3), 6 (Area 4), 7 (Area 5), 3 (Area 6) semester units. total_units left null rather than computed.",
   "Area 3 total (6 units, one course from each of 3A and 3B) and Area 5 total (7 units, one physical and one biological science) are printed for the area, not per group, so group blocks have stated null.",
   "Area 4 requires 2 courses in two different disciplines.",
   "Area 5C lab requirement may also be satisfied by underlined (lab) courses in 5A or 5B; underlining is not visible in the extracted text.",
   "ge_pattern left null: the award is the Cal-GETC pattern itself rather than a degree naming a GE pattern; its area courses are recorded as blocks.",
   "The line 'This area in not part of Cal-GETC. (Optional Requirements Outside of CAL-GETC)' follows Area 6; it is read as introducing the CSU American Institutions and UC LOTE requirements below it, which are not recorded as blocks. Reviewer should confirm it does not refer to Area 6. Those sections name ASL 101, SPAN 101, SPAN 102 (not in closed list) and POLS C1000/H, HIST C1001/H, HIST C1002/H.",
   "ETHS-106 is printed with a hyphen; treated as ETHS 106 in the closed list.",
   "SOCI 106/132/132H/141/141H are printed with subject SOCI while the closed list has SOC; marked as catalog additions.",
